  "proposer": "",
  "summary": "Can the Cohn-Elkies scheme be used to prove the optimal bound for circle-packings?",
  "detail": "Can the Cohn-Elkies scheme be used to prove the optimal bound for circle-packings? Cohn-Elkies developed a linear programming approach that proved optimal sphere packing in dimensions 8 and 24. Whether their method extends to circles in the plane remains a major open question in discrete geometry.",
