  "summary": "Is every connected subcomplex of a 2-dimensional aspherical CW complex also aspherical?",
  "detail": "Is every connected subcomplex of a 2-dimensional aspherical CW complex also aspherical? The Whitehead conjecture asks whether asphericity (having contractible universal cover) is preserved under taking subcomplexes in dimension 2. This would clarify the local structure of aspherical spaces and has connections to group theory and low-dimensional topology.",
