  "latex": "Is $\\|f(A)\\| \\leq 2\\sup_{z \\in W(A)} |f(z)|$ for all matrices $A$ and functions $f$ analytic on the numerical range?",
  "name": "Crouzeix's Conjecture",
  "en": "Crouzeix's Conjecture",
  "importance": 0.86,
