  "detail": "Is $r_5(N) \\ll N(\\log N)^{-c}$? Is $r_4(\\mathbb{F}_5^n) \\ll N^{1-c}$ where $N = 5^n$? Here $r_k(N)$ denotes the maximum size of a subset of $\\{1, \\ldots, N\\}$ with no $k$-term arithmetic progression. Kelley-Meka (2024) resolved the $k=3$ case. For $k \\geq 5$, Leng-Sah-Sawhney (2024) proved bounds of shape $r_k(N) \\ll Ne^{-(\\log \\log N)^{c_k}}$. Finding polynomial savings remains a central challenge in additive combinatorics.",
