  "id": "um-log-3342",
  "latex": "Positive Horn logic (pH) is the fragment of FO involving exactly $\\exists, \\forall, \\wedge, =$. Does the fragment $pH \\wedge \\neg pH$ have the finite …",
  "name": "Finite entailment of Positive Horn logic",
