  "detail": "What is the maximum number of givens for a minimal Sudoku puzzle? While minimal puzzles can have as few as 17 givens, the upper bound is unknown. A puzzle with many givens can still be minimal if each clue is essential. Computer searches have found minimal puzzles with around 40 givens, but no theoretical maximum is known. This question explores the relationship between redundancy, minimality, and constraint propagation in combinatorial problems.",
